      "the conversational insights devkit helps developers import conversations transcribe audio create recognizers transform transcript formats and manage global settings",
      "the virtual agent platform provides aggregated quality management metrics for virtual agent conversations including escalation rate latency and customer sentiment",
      "the agent engagement platform visualizes agent performance data provides ai generated summaries and highlights strengths and improvement areas relative to peers",
      "the conversational insights api supports bulk ingestion of audio conversation data from cloud storage with optional redaction and custom speech to text settings",
      "conversation datasets let users curate custom datasets from historical or uploaded conversations to test and evaluate agent assist summarization results",
      "agent assist summarization integration lets conversational insights use existing llm generators to create conversation summaries for export",
      "multiple scorecards let quality ai evaluate a single conversation against different criteria and show multiple conversation scores",
      "customer managed encryption keys let users control encryption key details audit logs and key lifecycles for agent assist features",
      "configurable dashboards let users build custom dashboards for usage and feedback metrics with chart options and ai assistance",
      "analysis rules for follow up analysis let cx insights analyze one group of conversations based on results from another group",
      "fine grained access control uses iam custom roles and authorized views to restrict visibility into specific dataset portions",
      "the ccai insights api uploads audio conversation data from cloud storage with optional redaction and analysis before upload",
      "quality ai helps evaluate contact center conversations and agent performance within the conversational insights console",
      "agent assessments evaluate individual conversations and let human evaluators add notes and feedback for the agent",
      "llm powered topic inference uses a topic model to analyze new conversations and identify topics in real time",
      "topic modeling discovers topics or call drivers in conversations between contact center agents and end users",
      "merged analysis displays previous results for each analysis type alongside the most recent analysis result",
      "correlation rules link related conversation segments together to form complete customer interaction views",
      "sentiment analysis detects the mood of a conversation and assigns a positive neutral or negative score",
      "autolabeling rules automatically apply key value labels to conversations based on defined conditions",
      "vpc service controls integration helps enforce service perimeters around ccai insights resources",
